{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんにちわかつきっ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"舞台についてのブログだよん( ºωº≡ºωº )"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/yumi.wakatsuki/img/blog/yumi.wakatsuki/img/2014/10/20/7868590/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"写メこうかーいヽ(*´∀｀)八(´∀｀*)ノ♥︎\n主演の川口春奈ちゃんっ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/yumi.wakatsuki/img/blog/yumi.wakatsuki/img/2014/10/20/7868590/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"横田美紀ちゃん(*/ω＼*)！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/yumi.wakatsuki/img/blog/yumi.wakatsuki/img/2014/10/20/7868590/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近\n3人でよく\n舞台終わりにご飯食べに行きますっ！\n優しくてめっちゃ話しやすくて可愛くて\n大好きな二人です(*ﾟｰﾟ)v\nこないだは\nスンドゥブチゲを食べに行ったよん！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/yumi.wakatsuki/img/blog/yumi.wakatsuki/img/2014/10/20/7868590/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"次は焼肉だねっ！笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして\n初日に来てくれた玲奈さん！！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/yumi.wakatsuki/img/blog/yumi.wakatsuki/img/2014/10/20/7868590/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お忙しい中ありがとうございましたっ！\n終わった後、玲奈さんが凄い自然だったと褒めて下さって凄い嬉しかったぁぁぁ⁽⁽ ◟(∗ ˊωˋ ∗)◞ ⁾⁾"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さぁ、まだまだ公演は沢山ありますっ！\n笑って楽しんでいきますっ！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みんな観に来てねっ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちなみに\n世にも奇妙な物語見た方いますか！？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"【ファナモ】は【生きてるものはいないのか】と同じ前田さんの作品なんですよヽ(*´∀｀)八(´∀｀*)ノ"}],"source":"archive"}